# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform, so include_str! data,
# content hashes and goldens of text assets are the same on Windows (ADR-0036).
# The `eol` CI step fails on a CRLF in a tracked text file.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.rpak binary
